flowchart TD
  CALL["A function call"] --> ABI{{"Which ABI?"}}
  ABI -->|"System V x86-64"| SV["Ints: rdi rsi rdx rcx r8 r9<br/>floats: xmm0–7<br/>128-byte red zone"]
  ABI -->|"Windows x64"| WIN["Four positional slots<br/>rcx rdx r8 r9 / xmm0–3<br/>32-byte shadow space"]
  ABI -->|"AAPCS64"| ARM["x0–x7 and v0–v7<br/>Apple tweaks variadics"]
  SV --> PRO["Prologue: save registers,<br/>reserve the frame"]
  WIN --> PRO
  ARM --> PRO
  PRO --> CFI["Cross-check with CFI<br/>the compiler's own record"]
